<title>USA: Digi International Inc Q1 Dec 31 loss.</title>
<headline>Digi International Inc Q1 Dec 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31	     1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales					$42,236,213   $43,716,263</p>
<p> Operating (Loss) Income	     ( 1,739,682)     7,015,767</p>
<p> AetherWorks Corporation Net Loss  ( 1,519,789)    ( 279,307)</p>
<p> Net (Loss) Income		     ( 2,578,007)     4,521,921</p>
<p> Net (Loss) Income Per Share		(  .19)	     .33</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding				13,354,080    13,902,733</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss for fiscal 1997 first quarter, ended December 31, 1996, includes a $1.52 million net loss from AetherWorks Corp, a development-stage company in which Digi owns a stake.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
